  "guid": "com.acidphantasm.enablelabyrinth",
  "name": "Enable Labyrinth",
  "slug": "enable-labyrinth",
  "teaser": "Enables Labyrinth for PMCs and Scavs. Adds a custom exfil point for Scavs at the same location as the non-secret exfil for PMCs. Requirements for entry are removed.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/moTTEdLsNmHB2CesJ9ovhkefd5mzqh95Na8EhN0S.png",
  "downloads": 39315,
  "favourites_count": 84,
  "description": "<p>Mod Features</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Enables Labyrinth</li>\n<li>Removed Labyrinth entry requirements</li>\n<li>Adds Scav Exfiltration Point to Labyrinth (available immediately)</li>\n<li>Adds Scav Raid Reductions similar to other maps (Based on Factory Raid Adjustments for Scav Late Spawns)</li>\n<li>Is compatible with Lacyway’s PVE Tweaks</li>\n<li>Configuration options available for adjusting PMC Extract on Labyrinth</li>\n<li>Configuration option to force the secret exfil key to spawn on Shadow of Tagilla</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download Enable Labyrinth</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded zip file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the SPT &amp; BepInEx folders in the zip file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT &amp; BepInEx folders from 7-zip into your SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3N6gTe2.gif\" alt=\"3N6gTe2.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/Bepinex/plugins/acidphantasm-enablelabyrinth</code></li>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/SPT/user/mods/acidphantasm-enablelabyrinth</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">CONFIG</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Configuration</p>\n<p>To edit the configuration run your server after installing and go to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://127.0.0.1:6969/enablelabyrinth/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://127.0.0.1:6969/enablelabyrinth/</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>All configs can be updated and edited while the server is running.</p>\n<p><em>Some settings require a client restart. They are marked as such</em></p>\n<p><strong>If you are using Fika then put the appropriate IP and port instead.</strong></p></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n",
